  "CharacterDescription": "A daughter of Ser Steffon Swyft, a landed knight of the Westerlands sworn to House Lannister. The middle child among her sisters, she has grown up learning that middle children must find their own way to be noticed in a family where the eldest gets the precedence and the youngest gets the indulgence. She is observant and quietly competitive in the way of someone who has had to be.\n\nThe Swyfts are minor Lannister bannermen — comfortable, loyal, unremarkable. She knows this and is not entirely at peace with it, though she would not say so.",
